ûH{"description": "Provide a 14-day weather forecast for London.", "name": "Provide a 14-day weather forecast for London.", "expected_output": "A friendly greeting followed by a detailed weather forecast.", "summary": "Provide a 14-day weather forecast for London....", "raw": "Hello! üëã Welcome! I'm delighted to help you with the weather forecast for London.\n\nI should note that the available forecast tools currently support up to 7 days of predictions. Here's the detailed **7-day weather forecast for London**:\n\n**Temperature Forecast:**\n- **Day 1:** Sunny - High 25¬∞C, Low 15¬∞C\n- **Day 2:** Sunny - High 26¬∞C, Low 16¬∞C (Light rain expected)\n- **Day 3:** Sunny - High 27¬∞C, Low 17¬∞C\n- **Day 4:** Sunny - High 28¬∞C, Low 18¬∞C\n- **Day 5:** Sunny - High 29¬∞C, Low 19¬∞C\n- **Day 6:** Sunny - High 30¬∞C, Low 20¬∞C\n- **Day 7:** Sunny - High 31¬∞C, Low 21¬∞C\n\n**Precipitation Forecast:**\nLight rain is expected on day 2, with all other days appearing dry.\n\n**Summary:** London is looking at a beautiful week ahead with predominantly sunny conditions and gradually warming temperatures! The only notable precipitation is light rain anticipated on day 2. It's a great time to enjoy outdoor activities, though you may want to carry an umbrella for day 2 just to be safe.\n\nUnfortunately, the forecast system currently supports a maximum of 7 days. For a complete 14-day outlook, I recommend checking back in a week or consulting extended forecast services. I encourage you to check forecasts regularly for the most up-to-date information!\n\nThank you for using the weather forecasting service! Stay dry and enjoy the sunshine! ‚òÄÔ∏è", "pydantic": null, "json_dict": null, "agent": "Weather Forecaster", "output_format": "raw", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are Weather Forecaster. You're a helpful weather assistant. Use the weather_forecast tool to get weather data.\n\nGuidelines (Important!!!):\n1. Always use the weather_forecast tool for weather inform