ry:** London is looking at a beautiful week ahead with predominantly sunny conditions and gradually warming temperatures! The only notable precipitation is light rain anticipated on day 2. It's a great time to enjoy outdoor activities, though you may want to carry an umbrella for day 2 just to be safe.\n\nUnfortunately, the forecast system currently supports a maximum of 7 days. For a complete 14-day outlook, I recommend checking back in a week or consulting extended forecast services. I encourage you to check forecasts regularly for the most up-to-date information!\n\nThank you for using the weather forecasting service! Stay dry and enjoy the sunshine! ‚òÄÔ∏è"}], "tool_failures": []}], "token_usage": {"total_tokens": 19232, "prompt_tokens": 17142, "cached_prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 2090, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_tokens": 0, "successful_requests": 8}}J&
